<item>
<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-29T17:01:06.689Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:01:06 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed seven civilians in a Plateau community and shot Islamic cleric Yahaya Masussuka dead in Katsina, while a separate gang attack in Binnari, Taraba left at least 62 dead. Bandits seized logistics supplies in Benue and attempted abductions in Zamfara, where troops rescued two herders and recovered livestock, and in Sokoto where troops foiled a terrorist ambush. Military operations destroyed a bomb-making hideout in Borno, killed 15 terrorists and two ISWAP commanders, and neutralised 44 terrorists in another Borno strike. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNaTZHekRTSzFOQThfNS00SWJLT1hjNlRPdHIzTl9KbWh1b1lkR1dYcTBhZXdfSloyZERTX2ZMV1ZmZXpXZW5qZE95bXRqOGIwSDBPTzdldXBqYS14eWhwWFhUdzUwLWNiRDNvenZXb0F2UWJVMXNnMVJYb2JXeFc2dzl6VEQ4a3VRcTBnUURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE83bEJFN3QwcG93Mkh5dDJ4SVdKWFRHZkxTZmtlZ0dHb0N3V1BFTzFBdTB3aGYyRHNVUHVRSm1OZjNwc0swVWFhNFJ0N0JOV3FJLUZzdWVySk9WWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOVlRMU0JFUzZieFp4N3RmVnBsM1B3ZGIzMXdic18waHFJYkh2QlY3WktpVGhOUjloNDgtMkJIUmdiVkpQb1NvemZvWHBqeEt3TmdoYmRTekJsck1YVnp2U2NFb2taTnFuWkNrNExFNHFKbXdBSUlIdzhjaTNuVElVYTYwNVRtRG9QbXJiQktjckh3YUdjaTJGbjNkV2MtY3FPcnpWTTRoWVBSTmVFaG1PSU5MVXhCR0pvQXpjRERmS2lFU0djRjdGYzZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Accord Newspaper&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxQdFhxYWV5TGJuMVp2QTIwb3pTZE00OUkyRmxjUUQ1c2FQT1ZTUWRqX2YwUFEwSjBrRHJlb3IzSWVSbURyUnEwUnp0N2tPZmlMSzlqT3MtU09LTE5uX1dDTmRFU3RtdUswbGQxZnRYNEMwbHFxd2pXYUlFai1SOHpqNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss